OL,3,GNEWSAOff-roaders caught damaging
OL,4,Aprotected site after posting videos to
OL,5,ATikTok
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men have been convicted of
OL,8,Fcriminal damage after videos of them
OL,9,Fusing off-road vehicles to cause
OL,10,F"irreversible" harm to a protected area
OL,11,Fwere posted to TikTok.
OL,13,FJohn Robinson, Michael Williams and
OL,14,FJoseph Hodgson were part of a convoy
OL,15,Fthat drove the vehicles from Liverpool
OL,16,Fto the Berwyn Site of Special
OL,17,FScientific Interest (SSSI),
OL,18,FDenbighshire.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
